sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title UC2-B Officer reviews a resubmission, compares and resolves
    actor Ofc as Officer
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI (api → services)
    participant DF as domain.diff
    participant WF as domain.workflow
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Ofc->>UI: open notification "Pre-Site Resubmitted"
    UI->>API: GET /officer/applications/{id}
    API->>DB: load revisions N-1 and N, feedback, documents
    API->>DF: diff(rev N-1, rev N)
    DF-->>API: changed sections + document changes
    API-->>UI: officer view with "Changed" markers, feedback states (open / addressed)

    Ofc->>UI: Compare with previous
    UI->>API: GET /applications/{id}/compare?from=N-1&to=N
    API->>DF: diff(from, to)
    API-->>UI: field-level old/new, documents added/removed/replaced

    Ofc->>UI: mark feedback item Resolved
    UI->>API: POST /officer/applications/{id}/feedback/{fid}/resolve
    API->>DB: feedback = resolved (resolved_by, resolved_at), audit feedback.resolved
    API-->>UI: 200

    alt another round needed
        Ofc->>UI: add new feedback, Request resubmission (see UC2-A)
    else no open feedback
        Ofc->>UI: Schedule site visit
        UI->>API: POST /officer/applications/{id}/transition {target: site_visit_scheduled}
        API->>WF: transition(under_review → site_visit_scheduled, officer, ctx{open_feedback = 0})
        API->>DB: status, audit, notification ("Pending Site Visit")
        API-->>UI: 200
    end
